   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/p3pp1p/2pp1np1/8/2P1P3/3B4/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 8",
   "line": [
    "g6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The pawn to g6 prepares the fianchetto — the natural way to meet White's clamp, putting the bishop on the long diagonal against the loosened dark squares.",
